  that looks live and isn't.

  letibot's cards sit at [1mcolumn 4[0m, its prose at [1m2[0m; every row of ours was at 2. That's why a turn read as one flat column. Now fixed — and reasoning is a folded row ([36m▸ Thought · N lines · ctrl-r[39m) with the [36m┃[39m
  rail, instead of the whole working-out inline.

